      {
        "id": 164222,
        "name": "skoticus",
        "username": "skoticus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/skoticus/{size}/1964_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-05T16:59:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I threw them all out. And I even remember thinking \"Why are they still including these, does anyone even use them?\" Apparently people do!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It was fun to look at them, but they don't go with our house at all. I did suggest to my wife that maybe someday, when we have a game room, but we both know that's never going to happen...so. Anyhow, it's fun to see, but honestly, I'd be just as happy with some digitial files of the artwork so we could see them close up still. If I had older kids I would probably keep them if they wanted them for their rooms, and even though I do have one child now, he's still only old enough to chew on it, so, he doesn't care.</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
